---
import { AUTHOR, REVIEW_STATUS } from '../../config/site';
---
<aside class="rounded-xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white p-5" aria-label="About this site's editorial process">
  <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Editorial note</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink">Editorial research: <a href={AUTHOR.url} class="font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4">{AUTHOR.name}</a>.</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">{REVIEW_STATUS}.</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Standby Generator Guide is an independent educational resource. We verify specifications against manufacturer documentation where possible, label estimates as estimates, and never accept payment for brand rankings. See our <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="underline decoration-accent underline-offset-4">editorial policy</a>. Spot an error? <a href="/contact/" class="underline decoration-accent underline-offset-4">Tell us the page URL and your source</a> — substantiated corrections are published promptly.</p>
</aside>
